  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"This child is not my daughter.\"*\n\nAriel was born in the Marquis family, where she was abused and abandoned. She ended up with a miserable death after a life of endless misfortune. Then she woke up, and she was nine years old again. In order to not repeat her miserable life, Ariel decides to have a contractual marriage with the son of the grand duke, Lakarter, who is famous for blood and madness. \n\n*\"What are all these keys for?\"*\n\nThe housekeeper glanced at the keys and laughed.\n\n*\"These keys are for the treasury of the grand duke’s family.\"*\n\nShe can use all of them as she pleases because they are all hers.\n\n(Source: Kakao, translated and edited)\n\n*Note: This is a promotional oneshot for the web novel of the same name.*",
